
(7 gansal?) tinuod: { Gawas isulat: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], bag-ong-linya. }, kon-dili: { Gawas isulat: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 pares?) tinuod: { Gawas isulat: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], bag-ong-linya. }, kon-dili: { Gawas isulat: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 pares?) tinuod: { Gawas isulat: ['WRONG!']. }, kon-dili: { Gawas isulat: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], bag-ong-linya. }.
(6 gansal?) tinuod: { Gawas isulat: ['WRONG!']. }, kon-dili: { Gawas isulat: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], bag-ong-linya. }.
